  performance_blocker: Correctness passed, but the release graph is not operationally acceptable. Test `publishes deterministic site descendants only after complete generated-byte readback` took 6,381,891.9148 ms, and shard 8 took 7,853,326.4993 ms. The declared 360,000 ms Node test timeout did not preempt synchronous validation. Preserve these timings, do not call them normal, and do not weaken graph, readback, redaction, or authority checks. Before release operations are considered enterprise-ready, preregister and prove a bounded algorithmic replacement with equivalent fail-closed semantics.
