    two_build_identity: Equality report `D:\TinyRustLM-vnext-20260812\repro-proofs\package-repro-9e60539\equality.json`, SHA256 `f28076ab5e5344147e00f7badc0a367d7510b9a0233fceea0d357c5784e5984d`, records `status=pass`, 8/8 exact package identities, and zero mismatches. Generation records have SHA256 `49ed1570d34ad3417b5211c4f3a78b3372afd0c58f8eec3616501e05e9e6afcb` and `932c432b1eeeda6ad908f47dbd91c6634cd83e1f3994c7b02f01ffed07e2dd36`.
