    phase_3_browser_campaign_evidence_checkpoint:
      status: Commit `10e4a0d4019bd0034796d872feb16bbd22ac2233` (`feat(evidence): replace browser campaign ABI`) is pushed and remote-exact. It cleanly replaces the unpublished plan-only browser module with the sole generated `tinyrustlm.vnext.campaign-evidence-wasm.v1` ABI. It is local cross-runtime conformance evidence, not a production runner, release, deployment, model qualification, browser campaign round, live memory operation, outside proof, catalog announcement, or Phase 3 completion.
      clean_replacement: The old profile, generator, generated adapter, test, package scripts, browser global, and boundary documentation are deleted. No alias, second module, old global, migration reader, dual contract, handwritten JavaScript campaign semantics, or runtime fallback remains. ADR-011 records the material decision and `docs/architecture/vnext-campaign-evidence-wasm-boundary.md` is the detailed current authority.
