      verification: The focused runner suite passed 13/13; the adjacent receipt, subject, artifact, projection, Rust-vector, generated-WASM, inventory, threat-review, and offline-bundle boundary passed 100/100; and complete `npm run test:unit` passed 840/840 with zero failures and zero skipped in 69.274 seconds, including real Chromium fault, package-consumer recovery, generated campaign-evidence WASM, and local release-smoke coverage. JavaScript syntax, strict profile parsing, exact hashes and byte counts, `git diff --check`, stale-reference review, ASCII, NUL, bounded secret/private-path scan, staged diff, and remote identity checks passed.
      deployment_truth: No production deployment-manifest member changed. Publishing unchanged site bytes would fabricate a release, so no version, Updates entry, deployment, release receipt, public readback claim, or campaign counter was created. The coherent internal implementation and maintained architecture documentation were committed and pushed immediately after all affected gates passed.
