    completed_phase_gate: ADR-001 through ADR-011 are accepted in `docs/architecture/adr/`; they freeze metadata grammar, SHA-256/Merkle identity, alignment/layout, companion transport, browser persistence, quantization profiles, WebGPU support, specialist composition, service-worker release behavior, evidence signing, and the sole campaign-evidence browser boundary.
