  slmcomposer_public_local_launch_2026_07_01: wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/slmcomposer-public-local-launch-memory-2026-07-01.md routes SLMComposer.com live-site identity, local `.slm` file import, optional user-triggered Hugging Face discovery, and public-host proof with no `/models/` fetch before user action.
  slmcomposer_minimodel_catalog_import_2026_07_01: wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/slmcomposer-minimodel-catalog-import-memory-2026-07-01.md routes the default MiniModel.org catalog URL, metadata/local-list model selection, local `.slm` SHA-256 verification, and browser-local Rust/WASM import proof.
  slmcomposer_local_ai_dashboard_2026_07_01: wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/slmcomposer-local-ai-dashboard-memory-2026-07-01.md routes the high-fidelity dark dashboard redesign, beginner starter cards, left navigation, desktop/mobile Advanced Options, source popover, and local-only model byte boundary.
  tinyrustlm_huggingface_conversion_script_2026_07_02: wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/tinyrustlm-huggingface-conversion-script-memory-2026-07-02.md routes Hugging Face Metadata Search wording, conversion-required versus MiniModel-metadata-found result states, local conversion script handoff, and source chooser open-state smoke proof; SHA256 65C25BC60631C525D8F7346387ECEFC1DA512A4AEE7AA4CFE6F1AD3BFB9097CD.
  tinyrustlm_peer_offer_source_clarity_2026_07_02: wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/tinyrustlm-peer-offer-source-clarity-memory-2026-07-02.md routes Rust `peer-offer`/`validate-peer-offer`, `.minimodel-peer-offer` proof, clarified Hugging Face compatibility labels, Search Metadata open-state proof, and MiniModel peer-offer catalog fields; SHA256 B9A7200F6AA1B8F0A328502E46FFD980E419E7E66AA8E943066AF1FCBC9E7BBF.
  tinyrustlm_huggingface_p2p_source_flow_2026_07_02: wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/tinyrustlm-huggingface-p2p-source-flow-memory-2026-07-02.md routes the simple Hugging Face lane P2P toggle, `P2P Import` versus `Start Conversion` actions, disabled-P2P warning, and open-state smoke proof; SHA256 75827EF9DAD5DF84AEAF22BB50F00907D61423DF47B98D15CAF30F0F46FFB728.
